WEBVTT

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:04.570
What if your next step was clearer?

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.390
Welcome to Pro Trader Academy.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.510
Learn the foundations.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:13.970
Explore PROTrader, your chart-analysis
workspace.

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.820
Then turn what you learn into guided
practice.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.490
Start with ARIA.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:24.990
It explains market conditions and the checks
behind a setup,

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:28.900
so you can understand the reasoning—
including when the conditions say wait.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.090
Oracle summarises those same checks.

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:36.770
Here, eight out of ten agree.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:38.870
Eighty percent agreement.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:40.910
That counts matching conditions.

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.250
It is not the probability that a trade will
win.

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.690
Compare the output with the chart and your
own reasoning.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:51.550
The tools support your review.

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:52.780
You stay in control.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:58.810
In the Academy, follow a guided lesson,

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:01.690
practise with a supplied example, and save
your notes.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.870
Ask a question whenever you need help.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:06.140
Your instructor replies in the same thread.

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:11.350
New here? Choose Start Here.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.990
Build your foundations first,

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:15.520
then open a short guide when you need a
specific tool.

